      "writtenOn": "2023-06-20T19:48:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As noted earlier, this used to not be adjusted. The impact is not noticeable unless playing around in viewer. This is the reason for the differences in the `imagefiltersscaled` GM (for the GPU cases; the CPU cases also include the whole switch to sksl).",
